{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varmint is an atmospheric anthology set in a world of mechanical terrors. Precision platforming gameplay and larger than life bossfights combine for a thrilling test of skill, wit and memory. Play as one of three pests, useless in a world of machines, and outmaneuver the metallic gods of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid, Precise Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are tight and responsive. Movement is simple and approachable, yet has plenty of room for skill expression and mastery. Each playable character comes with a unique adaptation that shakes up your moveset, keeping movement fresh and engaging throughout the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tough but Fair Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks and hazards are consistent and telegraphed \u2014 no unnecessary RNG. Respawns are fast and checkpoints are frequent, so you can quickly get back in the action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totaling over 300 screens of platforming challenges, brutal boss gauntlets, and stylized spectacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Act Structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique Acts to test your meddle, each upping the challenge with new abilities, locations, mechanics, and foes. Experience the silent stories of three vermin, each uniquely broken by their ashen world. Uncover a meta-narrative woven between each act and glimpse into the tragedy of a lonesome god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test in a never-ending gauntlet of mechanical onslaught. How long can you survive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940450?t=1756794032","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3940450?t=1756794032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/35fca842b3406bd9eb194c9d7b2155fb9bc4c030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756794032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/35fca842b3406bd9eb194c9d7b2155fb9bc4c030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756794032","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varmint is an atmospheric anthology set in a world of mechanical terrors. Precision platforming gameplay and larger than life bossfights combine for a thrilling test of skill, wit and memory. Play as one of three pests, useless in a world of machines, and outmaneuver the metallic gods of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fluid, Precise Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/1e906396745557bd0cb2656e41fe73be.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are tight and responsive. Movement is simple and approachable, yet has plenty of room for skill expression and mastery. Each playable character comes with a unique adaptation that shakes up your moveset, keeping movement fresh and engaging throughout the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tough but Fair Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/b89d73f102887eb099046fa49d083da1.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacks and hazards are consistent and telegraphed \u2014 no unnecessary RNG. Respawns are fast and checkpoints are frequent, so you can quickly get back in the action!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cinematic Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.poster.avif?t=1756794032\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.webm?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/extras/f363324f671a3d5015979518d2e5c116.mp4?t=1756794032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Totaling over 300 screens of platforming challenges, brutal boss gauntlets, and stylized spectacles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Act Structure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique Acts to test your meddle, each upping the challenge with new abilities, locations, mechanics, and foes. Experience the silent stories of three vermin, each uniquely broken by their ashen world. Uncover a meta-narrative woven between each act and glimpse into the tragedy of a lonesome god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your skills to the test in a never-ending gauntlet of mechanical onslaught. How long can you survive?</p>","developers":["DirtyOnion"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3940450/b79f9334f148314401cbbea5dbddcd4a5ad74b08/header.jpg?t=1756794032","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185231,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185231/movie480.mp4?t=1755735123","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185231/movie_max.mp4?t=1755735123"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185231/14cbb2c89f78d809503bbcd23f87df56c595a0d0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755735123","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185231/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755735123","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185231/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755735123"}}],"name":"Varmint","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements have not been tested extensively. WIll likely work on